`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"ff7ee74854e90ad286dc9d0a679ddc5a","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"a1d8c9b1f4619f94b10bba080eb3e3b8","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"2a457a93fabc54b1d0d623c43a0b1f4e","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c7faeb2f49431dfdab6bb111b9915e6e","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"197e70528e53fe38d23d6e5e1ee924ed","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"546693617614d6cbba5ad961c5bcee55","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"341a9f8018af16eac1a555e1f6721b14","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"80ce7ebf2fbb5bf6bd73b7a25eb13024","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"ca5d4302f84a87b3792fc67e94b661fd","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1795013877694,"stop":1795013877797,"duration":103,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value":